@base = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1
@postId = 1

### Create user (change username if already exists)
POST {{base}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "creator_demo",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "role": "CREATOR",
  "ratePerPost": 500000,
  "maxDailyPosts": 3,
  "level": 1
}

### Update user partially
PUT {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ratePerPost": 600000}

### User detail
GET {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Filter users
GET {{base}}/api/users?page=0&size=10&role=CREATOR&status=ACTIVE

### Create campaign: 3 days, cost = current rate x 3
POST {{base}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "advertiserName": "Shop ABC",
  "advertiserEmail": "ads@example.com",
  "advertiserPhone": "0900000000",
  "startDate": "25/07/2026",
  "endDate": "28/07/2026",
  "numberOfPosts": 2,
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### Partial update and recalculate cost
PUT {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endDate": "29/07/2026"}

### Detail includes user object
GET {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Filter campaigns
GET {{base}}/api/posts?page=0&size=10&advertiserName=Shop&status=SCHEDULED

### Validation: 406/status 2
PUT {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numberOfPosts": 11}

### Cancel campaign
DELETE {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Deactivate user
DELETE {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Re-run create campaign to see 400/status 5
